title: Sign-Based Lighting & Traffic Sign Deglare (SBLM & TSDG)
raw_community_title: Sign-Based Light Mode & Traffic Sign Deglare
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: Lariat / Platinum / Flash (Matrix LED Headlamps)
source_sheet: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix LED Comparison & Livnitup Master Database
status: untested
notes: 'UNTESTED / EXPERIMENTAL: Enables two camera-driven road sign lighting features
  used on European Ford

  Matrix LED headlamps. (1) Sign-Based Light Mode (SBLM) uses the IPMA front camera
  to recognize

  approaching junctions, roundabouts, yield, and stop signs and pre-widens the headlight
  beam into

  the intersection. (2) Traffic Sign Deglare (TSDG) dims the specific Matrix high-beam
  LEDs shining

  directly onto highly reflective road signs so they do not dazzle the driver when
  Glare-Free High

  Beams are active. There is no separate APIM toggle specifically for TSDG (it operates
  automatically

  whenever Glare-Free High Beams are switched on), but APIM 7D0-09-02 (Bit 3 of Nibble
  9) is included

  to enable the Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR) toggle in SYNC 4 if not already enabled.


  NOTE ON HCM CHECKSUMS: All HCM edits must be written as exact nibble values (never
  relative offsets). Because the HCM uses a secondary calibration CRC at 734-11-01,
  an external checksum calculator is required — reach out to Firn on the F-150 Lightning
  Forum or 14th Gen F-150 Forum to discuss.


  Note that HCM 734-05-01 xxxx xxx* also supports value 2 (SLME Traffic sign deglare
  ON) if testing against value 1 (SLME Enable).'
steps:
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-01
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_SBLM (MFCSBLM)
      target_state: MFCSBLM Enabled
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-02
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx x*--
    community_hex: D
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)
      target_state: TSR Enabled
- module: HCM
  address: 734-01-02
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 1 to enable Traffic Sign Deglare (TSDGE Enable).
    An external HCM checksum calculator is required for 734-11-01 — reach out to Firn
    on the F-150 Lightning Forum or 14th Gen F-150 Forum to discuss.'
  targets:
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
    # Bit positions preserved for future AsBuiltPro HCM CRC calculator support:
    # bits:
    # - bit: 0
    #   action: 1
    #   feature_name: m2_TSDG_Enable (TSDGE)
    #   target_state: TSDGE Enable
- module: HCM
  address: 734-05-01
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 1 (SLME Enable) or 2 (SLME Traffic sign deglare
    ON). An external HCM checksum calculator is required for 734-11-01 — reach out
    to Firn on the F-150 Lightning Forum or 14th Gen F-150 Forum to discuss.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxx* xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
    # Bit positions preserved for future AsBuiltPro HCM CRC calculator support:
    # bits:
    # - bit: 0
    #   action: 1
    #   feature_name: m2_SbLM_Enable (SLME)
    #   target_state: SLME Enable
recipe_version: '1.1'
